window.products.push({"id":147008,"name":"Reusable K-cup, 4 Refillable Stainless Mesh Coffee Filters Compatible With Keurig 2.0, K200, K300, K400, K500 series and 1.0 Brewers","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81XSveByErL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Welcome to STYDDI store to buy the Reusable Coffee Filter ,you can enjoy your coffee times while stop wasting your money on prepackage k cup reusable filters and saving the environment. Compatible with Keurig Brewer Models: Keurig Family 1.0 Brewers : B10, K10, B30, B31, B40, B44, K45, B50, B60, K65, B66, B70, K75, B77, B79, B100, B130, B135, B140, B145, K145, B100, B130, B135, B140, B145, B150, K155, B200, B1250, B1255, B3000 Keurig 2.0 Brewers : K200, K250, K300, K350, K360, K400, K450, K460, K500, K550, K560, K575 Any of the following machines : Elite,Classic, Ultra, Special Edition, Ultimate, and Platinum. Features and Benefits: -Can be used for coffee, tea and hot chocolate -Completely 100% BPA, Lead, and DEHP Free for Your Safety -No need to remove the Keurig K-cup Holder or Filter Holster, simply fill the Reusable K-cup Coffee Filter, place it in your machine and brew normally. -The use of the Reusable K-cup Coffee Filter allows you to reduce your impact on the environment, lower your costs, double your value and increase your personal choices. -This unit has a an integrated stainless steel laser perforated mesh that ensures a clean full and even extraction of the very best attributes your coffee has to offer. -Super lightweight and very easy to clean and 100% dishwasher safe. -FREE BONUS(Cleaning Brush) -Great gift for the coffee lovers. Package include: *4x Purple Reusable Coffee Filter *1x Cleaning Brush","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81XSveByErL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"STYDDI","source_asin":"B06XDDY87X","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-147008","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B06XDDY87X","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Appliances.jsonl","source_asin":"B06XDDY87X","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":147009,"name":"Waterdrop WF401 Refrigerator Water Filter, Replacement for Amana Clean N Clear WF401, WF401S, 12527304, 46-9014, 469014, 3 Filters","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":40.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71vqjWHY+GL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"A filter you can trust: This filter we put our name to adopts high-precision natural activated carbon block to execute the best water purification performance. It effectively reduces chlorine, taste and odor, rust, corrosion, sediment, and turbidity. Simply replace your filter every six months, or after 350 gallons, and enjoy the clean water you and your family deserve. This has been tested and proven by an independent third-party laboratory. Selected filtration material: Our dedicated R&D team works day and night to ensure our filters provide your family with the purest, safest water anywhere in the world. By harnessing the power of natural active coconuts sourced from Sri Lanka, we adopt the coconut activated carbon block that ensures you get nothing but the best when you choose our products. Replacement for models: WF401, 12527304, WF40, 46-9904, WF292, WSA-1, Tier1 RWF1090, Amana WF401P, WF401S, WF401T, WF292, BCF92. Perfect fit: Waterdrop combines precision measurement technology to perfectly reproduce the original scale parameters with advanced industrial automation equipment. We aim to produce 100%-fit refrigerator water filters with an exquisite engineering design, unlike inferior replacement filters that have issues with water leakage. Also, we strive to save your precious time by offering tool-free, no-mess refrigerator water filter replacement. Fresh-tasting water: The 100% coconut shell carbon block can adsorb more impurities than low-priced and mixed carbon block. The Waterdrop WF401 refrigerator water filter significantly improves the taste of drinking water to bring you a unique experience. Be responsible for each product: Each product, or even a small component manufactured by Waterdrop, must pass an extremely high-standard examination to reach the top requirements on the market. These standards don’t end once the filter leaves our factory. Waterdrop will take full responsibility for each filter. Our 24/7 customer service team will provide a water purification solution at any time. Purified with love: We believe everyone, wherever they are, has the right to drink pure water. We hope to use what benefits us to benefit more people. For every purchase, we donate clean water to children in water-scarce regions in Africa.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71vqjWHY+GL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"WATERDROP","source_asin":"B07YB3RDY5","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-147009","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07YB3RDY5","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Appliances.jsonl","source_asin":"B07YB3RDY5","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
