window.products.push({"id":147039,"name":"2 Pack Refrigerator Door Locks with 4 Keys White","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61NYvkaajdL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"The REZIPO refrigerator door lock is simple. It will instantly stick to fridge, not require drilling or screws. The lock is small and compact. So it does not look so big on your refrigerator. Lock up anything you want! MULTI-FUNCTION use as:  Refrigerator lock Freezer Lock Cabinet Lock Cupboard Lock File Drawer Lock Health Cabinet Lock Printer Tray Lock Paper Tray Lock This Lock can be used for many things. Keep Kids, handicapped people, and anyone out of that certain Drawer, fridge, or cabinet.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61NYvkaajdL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"REZIPO","source_asin":"B07V231NGX","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-147039","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07V231NGX","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Appliances.jsonl","source_asin":"B07V231NGX","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":147040,"name":"COWSAR Nugget Ice Maker Countertop, Portable Machine with Self-Cleaning Function, 44lbs in 24Hrs, Pebble ice Maker with 24H Timer, for Kitchen/Home/Of","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81wE2iGfs2L._SL1500_.jpg","description":"【NUGGET ICE - THE GOOD ICE】 Also called “Pebble”, “Pellet”, “Chewable”, “opal” or even “Sonic” ice. Unlike traditional hard ice cubes，nugget ice is light and airy, incredibly satisfying to chew on. It doesn’t hurt your teeth. Nugget ice is Favored by bartenders and restaurants for flavor absorbing ability and perfect for cocktails, sodas and other beverages. 【44LBS OF ICE PER DAY】10 minutes fast nugget ice making, up to 44Lbs per 24 hours production capacity, plus a 2.4L water reservoir, you'll always have fresh pebble ice. Before you have to drive to chain stores for it, while now you can have it directly from your countertop whenever you like! 【SELF-CLEANING & 24H TIMER】Our ice makers countertop is equipped with a self-cleaning function. Simply add water to the tank and long-press the ICE/CLEAN button for 5s to initiate automatic cleaning. You can set the nugget ice maker to switch ON or OFF auto within 24 hours. When you wake up in the morning or get home from work in the evening, You can get a lot of ice from the ice machine immediately. 【EASY TO USE】The countertop ice maker is equipped with a smart LCD panel. Any function can be solved in the Self-explanatory control panel：1-24H timing, ice full reminder, water shortage reminder, self-cleaning. The visible window allows you to monitor the ice making process at any time without opening. The ice maker countertop comes with an ice basket and ice scoop for easy ice storage. 【12-Month Warranty & Lifetime Tech Support】We value your satisfaction. All of our ice machines are covered by a 12-month warranty and lifetime tech support. If you have any problems with our ice machine, please feel free to call our number, and our after-sales staff will provide you with professional technical support.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81wE2iGfs2L._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"COWSAR","source_asin":"B0B6BY693G","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-147040","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B6BY693G","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Appliances.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B6BY693G","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":147041,"name":"Exact Fit Parts EFP Humidifier Filter for 1041 Aircare, Essick & Bemis Model Humidifiers Replacement Wicking Filter | Includes 3 Aftermarket Filters","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":44.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51jkrptjQqL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"EFP Replacement Humidifier Wicking Filters Compatible with 1041 Aircare Essick Air Bemis Model Humidifiers | Includes 3 High Quality, Aftermarket FiltersTHREE PACK: Includes 3 High Quality Aftermarket Replacement EFP Humidifier Wick Filters for 1041 Aircare Essick Air Bemis Model Humidifiers. Approximate Measurements: 16-5/8 x 9-7/8 x 5. Replacing your humidifier filter regularly ensures that harmful particles are removed from the water before it is released into the air. EFP High Output Interwoven Filter Designs help trap and retain mineral deposits for natural and clean humidification - No White Dust. EFP provides High Quality Replacement Parts that are a guaranteed Exact Fit and Affordably Priced compared to the OEM product. This is a high quality EFP Brand Replacement Part. ~Quality, Fit, and Workmanship are Fully Guaranteed. We offer a No-Hassle 30 -Day Money Back Guarantee on all EFP products so you can be confident in your purchase decision.Why should you replace your humidifier Filter?A humidifier is an essential household appliance, particularly for the winter months when the air becomes a lot drier and less humid. Your humidifier helps by dispersing water vapor into the air to replace the lost moisture. Most humidifiers contain filters, which help to keep the moist air clear of any impurities. They remove particles from the water before it is dispensed into the air. You need to change your filters regularly, so you can continue to enjoy healthy air and keep your humidifier in good condition. The frequency of changing depends on the quality of your household water supply and how often you are using the humidifier. There are many different types of humidifier filters. Check your user manual or the manufacturers website to make sure you know what type you need to buy.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51jkrptjQqL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Exact Fit Parts","source_asin":"B09KT5GB4H","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-147041","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09KT5GB4H","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Appliances.jsonl","source_asin":"B09KT5GB4H","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
