window.products.push({"id":147096,"name":"Luntak Front Load Washer Door Prop, Flexible Washing Machine Front Loader and Device to Keep Washer Door Open Fits Most Washing Machines-Black","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61tJWFlG02L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"[Keep Clean and Fresh]- The washer door prop includes a powerful magnet and an adjustable shape hose to help the air circulation of the washing machine,laundry door prop allows your washer to vent when not in use and helps reduce the stink building up,also save the need for frequent cleaning and expensive cleaning agents.The arm is very flexible so you can adjust to many lengths and angles. [Safety Material]- The front loader washer door prop surface of hose and base is wrapped with silicone, which will not rust or scratch your washing machine, and has a long service life. The hose can be bent, and then the magnet is installed outside the washing machine and dryer.You don't have to use door prop on these items, you can use it anywhere. [Strong Adsorption ]- The base size of the washing machine door prop is 2.6 inches, which can be attached to the machine over a large area, and the base is composed of 66 magnets, which are powerful and not easy to drop. Once stuck to the metal surface, the washer magnetic door holder will not move. If you want to reposition the front loader door prop, just pull the hose near the magnet firmly and then adsorb it again. [Multiple Uses]- ① Great for keeping the washer door open to reduce peculiar smell ② The magnetic washer door prop is adsorbed on the washing machine and can also be used as a drying rod, which can hang some items such as towels, socks, shoelaces, hair bands, neckties, hats, light clothes,etc. ③ The front loading washer door prop can be regarded as fix tools such as brooms and mops, which are easily blown down by the wind. [Easy to Use]- The washer door prop magnetic is detachable, easy to store, and does not occupy space. ① Screw the bottom of the hose and the hole on the base together ② Adsorb the front door washer prop directly on the surface of the washing machine ③ Adjust the shape of the hose by your needs.(note: This front load washer only has a hanging adsorption effect on metal shell machine , not suitable for plastic shell).","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61tJWFlG02L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Luntak","source_asin":"B0BGRFWL4P","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-147096","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BGRFWL4P","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Appliances.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BGRFWL4P","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
