window.products.push({"id":147116,"name":"Magic Chef Portable Countertop Ice Maker Display","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61Pwgb-d3yL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"The Magic Chef Portable Countertop Ice Maker in Silver can make up to 27 lb. of ice per day to help provide you with a steady supply of ice. It is just what you need to continuously fill your ice bucket or beverage pitchers when you are entertaining friends and family. The ice maker can conveniently hold up to 1.5 lb. of ice at a time, and the digital control panel indicates when the storage bin needs to be emptied. The ice maker produces ice in 2 sizes in as little as 7 minutes, and features a compact design that helps make it easily portable.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61Pwgb-d3yL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Magic Chef","source_asin":"B00JR20G5G","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-147116","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00JR20G5G","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Appliances.jsonl","source_asin":"B00JR20G5G","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":147117,"name":"EROMMY Chest Freezer, 3.5 Cubic Feet Small Deep Freezer, Mini Quiet Freezer with Storage Basket and Adjustable Legs, Upright Freezer for Home, Kitchen","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71ZEwA5aJlL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【LARGE CAPACITY & SMALL SIZE】The chest freezer with a capacity of 3.5 CU. FT, the size is 21.1\"(L)*18.9\"(W)*32.5\"(H). The mini fridge has a huge storage capacity beyond your imagination, you can use it as much as you want. And the mini size is very suitable for dormitories, apartments, offices, small shops, family kitchens. 【ENERGY SAVING AND LOW NOISE】The small deep freezer has ETL certification. It uses R600a high efficiency and low energy consumption compressor, which can be cooled quickly. It only consumes 0.55 kWh per day, which will help you save a lot of energy costs. In addition, this high-efficiency compressor will not bring you noise interference when working, so you can use it at home with confidence. 【REFRIGERATION & FREEZING】This mini deep freezer has both refrigeration and freezing functions. You can select the \"Refrigerate\" function to refrigerate the food (Temperature range: 32°F - 41°F), and select the \"Freeze\" function to freeze (below - 0.4°F). Choose a number between 1-strong and you can adjust the speed of freezing. 【HUMANIZED DESIGN】There are two hidden recessed handles on the top of the freezer chest, you can lift the top easily. We are equipped with a removable food basket inside the small refrigerator, which is convenient for storing smaller items. The adjustable table legs at the bottom can help the small refrigerator remain stable on uneven ground. 【CUSTOMER SERVICE】We provide 24 hours customer service in order to improve customer satisfaction. Any problems please feel free to contact us, we will solve within one day.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71ZEwA5aJlL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"EROMMY","source_asin":"B08Y6ZJZZX","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-147117","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08Y6ZJZZX","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Appliances.jsonl","source_asin":"B08Y6ZJZZX","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
