window.products.push({"id":147328,"name":"Portable Washing Machine with Draining Pump - Twin Tub Washer Machine with 7.9lbs Wash and 4.4lbs Spin Cycle Compartments by Think Gizmos","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61wbbj0yOKL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"WATER PUMP: Now includes a built-in water drain pump. The Strong And Durable Portable Washing Machines Features Two Tubs 1 For Washing And 1 For Spinning. It Has A Capacity Of 7.9lbs Wash And 4.4lbs Spin. Perfect for RV's, Camping, Camper Vans, Small Apartments or as a backup Washing Machine. Wash face masks quickly and easily, ideal for keeping face masks fresh and clean with the quick spin dry feature. COMPACT AND LIGHTWEIGHT: The compact and lightweight design of the Portable Washing Machine makes this ideal for places where space is limited such as for camping or in a caravan. It does not require plumbing and uses built in drainage pump to drain away. Only requires access to water and a drain area. The drain pipe will still need to be lower than the washing machine when using. WASH & SPIN TIMER: The wash cycle can run up to 15 minutes on either a soft or normal wash and the spin cycle can run up to 5 minutes which means the clothes can be washed for the time required. The Spin section will start draining as soon as wet clothes are added so ensure that the drainage pipe is adequately positioned. EASY TO USE: Simple to use simply add clothes, water and detergent and set the machine to wash. Once done give it a spin to try out and rinse through. Now includes a Lint Filter which, when placed in the wash section, will float on the water collecting any debris (string, lint etc). ALL PARTS INCLUDED: Everything needed for the machine to work is included (except water and detergent). Includes in the box is the Washing Machine, Water Fill Hose, Lint Filter and fully translated manual (Languages: English, French, German, Italian and Spanish).","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61wbbj0yOKL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Think Gizmos","source_asin":"B0946TGLTT","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-147328","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0946TGLTT","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Appliances.jsonl","source_asin":"B0946TGLTT","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
