window.products.push({"id":147402,"name":"WPY312959 (Y312959 312959) Dryer Belt Update by Blutoget - Fit for Whirlpool, May-tag Dryers- WPY312959VP maytag Dryer Belt Replace 3-12959, 3-14774, ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":10.77,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71zJ-GNe-UL._SL1500_.jpg","description":"√√【HIGH COMPATIBILITY】: WPY312959 maytag dryer belt compatible for Whirlpool, Maytag, Jenn-Air,Kenmore Dryers, Replaces PD00028571, WPY312959,3-12959, 3-14774, 312959, 314774, 4331997, LB234, P46-150, WPY312959VP, Y312959,1246110 AP6024192, PS11757542, EAP11757542,6 3129590.Please check the model for fit before ordering. If you are not sure if dryer belt 312959 is suitable for your dryer model, please contact us and we will be happy to solve the problem for you. √√【RUBBER MATERIAL】: Includes 1 x upgraded maytag belt wpy312959, color in black . The circumference of WPY312959 maytag dryer beltis 2527 mm or 100 inch. 3/8\" wide, 5 ribs, and 4 grooves to provide sturdy grip and smooth operation. WPY312959 maytag dryer belt is made from durable high-quality rubber - Ensure long-lasting and stable performance. 312959 maytag dryer belt fixes the following symptoms: Will not tumble | Noisy | Takes too long to dry | Will not start. √√【APPLICABLE PART】 :WPY312959 maytag dryer belt suitable for Maytag GDG8000, GDG882, LSE7804ACL, DE7400, DG7400, LDG7800, LDG7800AAL, LDG7800AAW, LDG7800ABL, LDG7800ABW, DG9700, DG810, DG212, GDG210, GDG212, DE4000, DE482, DE490, DE4910, DE512, DE590, DE608, DE612, DE8000, DE808, DE8410, DE8420, DE8500, DE8600, DE882, DG107, DG303, DG313, DG382, DG408, DG409,DG482, DG490, GDG7500, GDG7600, GDG810, GDG8200, GDG8300, GDG8410, GDG8420, GDG8500, GDG8600, GDG9700, GDG9800, GDG9900, ESE9900 etc. √√【UPGRADED 312959 Dryer Drum Belt】: WPY312959 Dryer Drum Drive Belt attaches to the motor pulley and spins the drum as the motor rotates.As the armature of the motor rotates, WPY312959 maytag dryer belt begins to move and turns the drum. Maytag belt WPY312959 is made of high strength rubber material, sturdy and not easy to get crack,running smoothly, long time using.Use our dryer belt 312959 maytag dryer belt to replace the broken belt, which can effectively solve problems of annoying noise. √√【EASY TO INSTALL】: You will need a 5/16 nut driver and a stubby Phillips screwdriver to complete the repair. Disconnect the power to the dryer and wear work gloves before install 312959 maytag dryer belt.Take a picture before disconnecting any wires to ensure proper reassembly. Remove the old belt. Position the new belt on the drum with the groove facing inward, then loop the belt on the pulley and motor shaft in a \"Z\" formation. Replace WPY312959 maytag dryer belt to solve your problem. √√【5 YEARS GUARANTEE】: 312959 maytag dryer belt is made of premium quality material, supports 5 YEARS return and exchange. We promise to ensure your absolute satisfaction with every purchase. Risk-free shopping. If you have any quality problem during warranty period, please contact customer service in time. We will try our best to solve the problem. Customer satisfaction is our tireless pursuit.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71zJ-GNe-UL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Blutoget","source_asin":"B09CLZ9RQZ","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-147402","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09CLZ9RQZ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Appliances.jsonl","source_asin":"B09CLZ9RQZ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
