window.products.push({"id":147424,"name":"DC97-07509B Wheel DC93-00634A Samsung Dryer Idler Pulley Dv45h7000ew/a2 Dv42h5000ew/a3 Dv42h5200ew/a3 Dv210aew/xaa Dv231aew/xaa Dv330aew/xaa Dv40j3000","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":7.95,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51whF68Iz6S._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"💡 Dc97-07509b Samsung Dryer Idler Pulley Wheel - A high-quality exact equivalent for part numbers AP6038887, DC93-00634A, DC61-01230B, DC96-00882B, DC96-00882C, PS11771601. DC93-00634A Dryer Idler Wheel is compatible with Samsung, Kenmore appliances. The idler wheel, also known as the idler pulley, is an essential part of a dryer's drum and belt system. It is responsible for maintaining tension on the dryer belt, which allows it to rotate smoothly and efficiently. 🔧 DIY eTips Included - Not sure how to replace the part? Helpful information can be found on the page below. Scroll down to get more repair tips. Acquire valuable skills during the DIY repair project. DC93-00634A Dryer Idler Assembly will help if your appliance is noisy, doesn't tumble, or doesn't start. Replacing the Dc93-00634a Dryer Idler Pulley Wheel is a straightforward process that can be easily done with our DIY eTips. To uninstall, the initial step is to turn off the dryer. 💡 Dc93-00634a Samsung Dryer Idler Pulley Replacement Wheels are made of high-quality materials that are designed to last. They are typically made of metal, with a durable plastic coating to protect against wear and tear. Dc93-00634a Idler Pulley Wheel is mounted on a shaft, which is attached to a bracket that is fixed to the dryer frame. Duet dryer pulley wheel meets or exceeds all manufacturer specifications. We provide a lifetime warranty and guarantee 100% money back. 💡 What happens when a dryer idler pulley goes bad? When a dryer idler pulley goes bad, it can cause several issues with the operation of the dryer, including squeaking or grinding noises, belt slipping off, drum not turning, and excessive vibration. The idler pulley is an important component of the dryer's drum belt system that helps to keep tension on the belt. If you suspect a problem with the idler pulley, it's essential to have it checked and repaired promptly to prevent further damage. 💡 Popular Models: 402.89032010, dv209agw, dv210aew/xaa, dv231aew/xaa, dv330aew/xaa, dv40j3000ew/a2, dv42h5000ew/a3, dv42h5000gw/a3, dv42h5200ef/a3, dv42h5200ep/a3, dv42h5200ep/ac, dv42h5200ew/a3, dv42h5200gw/a3, dv45h6300eg/a3, dv45h6300gg/a3, dv45h7000ew/a2, dv45h7000gw/a2, dv45k6200ew/a3, dv45k6500ev/a3, dv45k6500ew/a3, dv48h7400ew/a2, dv48h7400gw/a2, dv48j7700ew/a2, dv48j7770ep/a2, dv50f9a6evw/a2, dv50f9a7evp/a2, dv50f9a7evw/a2, dv50f9a8evp/a2, dv50k8600ev/a3, dv52j8700ep/a2, dv52j8700ew/a2.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51whF68Iz6S._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"PartsBroz","source_asin":"B07NPLMZ7C","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-147424","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07NPLMZ7C","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Appliances.jsonl","source_asin":"B07NPLMZ7C","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
