window.products.push({"id":147496,"name":"Empava EMPV-36GC23 36 Inch Stainless Steel Gas Cooktop & COSMO COS-5MU36 Under Cabinet Range Hood Ductless Convertible Duct, Slim Kitchen Stove Vent w","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":472.63,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41lk2+WT-fL._AC_SL1001_.jpg","description":"Empava EMPV-36GC23 36 Inch Stainless Steel Gas Cooktop Professional 5 Italy Sabaf Burners Stove Top Certified with Thermocouple Protection SilverAbout Us Empava's is a 5-Year US Based Manufacture specialized in selling high quality kitchen and bathroom products. Empava's is committed to providing every customer with the highest standard of customer service and best value products. Please do not hesitate to contact us if you have any questions or concerns. Empava's appliances are engineered to provide you with the highest quality cooking experience at an affordable price. Fully equipped for safety and functionality, Empava's appliances are easy to install, designed for the modern home and loaded with features. Empava's is continuously searching for innovations in gas technology, while dedicated to improving everyday culinary life! Specifications Voltage: 110V Installation: Built-In Ignition Type: Pulse Cable Length: 1. 8m Country of Origin: U. S. A. Main Material: Stainless Steel Natural Gas Regulator: Included Liquefied Petroleum Gas Conversion Kit: Included Thermocouple Flame-out Failure System (FFD): Included Cut-out Dimensions: 35. 03 Inch L x 19. 68 Inch W x R10 Product Dimensions: 36 inch L x 20. 66 inch W x 4. 52 inch H Heating Elements: 5 Burners, 12000 BTU +10000 BTU+6000 BTU+4000 BTU=38000 BTU Fuel type: Gas, Natural Gas (NG) are preset and can be replaced with Liquefied Petroleum Gas (LPG) nozzles to meet your different needs. The Pipe is not included. Features SAFETY PERFORMANCE The use of a thermocouple flameout fault system ensures that the gas is automatically turned off when no flame is detected, helping to avoid gas leakage. DURABLE QUALITY The gas cooker is made of stainless steel top, Stain and heat discoloration resistant stainless-steel surface will provide you with a reliable cooktop for years to come. EASY TO Cleanthes durable knobs and laser cut full-width edge-to-edge heavy cast iron grates can be cleaned in the dishwasher for hassle-free, effortless cleaning and maintenance to enhance the premium look. AFFORDABILITY & QUALITY The gas cooktop features a one-piece top, Enclosed chassis for effortless cleaning and maintenance without crevices to hold residue, ensuring you a neat and tidy kitchen space. HIGH POWER BURNER With 5 different versatile burner size with a Triple ring burner 12000 BTU, Rapid burner 10000 BTU, two Semi rapid burner 6000 BTU, Auxiliary burner 4000 BTU burner distribute even heat for simmer, boil, stir-frying, steaming, melting or even caramelizing! AFFORDABLE QUALITY The cooktop is equipped with built-in stainless steel gas stovetop, die-cast aluminum firearm, iron enamel burner caps and cast iron grates, which is easy to clean, providing you with a extremely durable cooktop for years to come. RELIABILITY & SAFETY The gas cooktop features with a 110V/60Hz plug-in ignition device, which can be ignited instantly without waiting, safe and convenient. In addition, the flame failure system is able to automatically turn off the stove if there is a leak or the stove top overheats. KINDLY NOTE: This is a gas unit that requires professional licensed technician to install per city/state safety code. Gas leakage test must be exercised prior to turning on the gas supply. .COSMO COS-5MU36 Under Cabinet Range Hood Ductless Convertible Duct, Slim Kitchen Stove Vent with, 3 Speed Exhaust Fan, Reusable Filter and LED Lights in Stainless Steel (36 inch)Cosmo’s COS-5MU36 36 inch under cabinet range hood has modern styling for any kitchen decor. Featured in brushed stainless steel, efficient airflow removes smells and odors with ease. Three aluminum mesh filters collect unwanted grease and oil from the air. Easy push-button controls make using our hood a breeze. Built-in LED lighting ensures visibility for cooking at all times of the day.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41lk2+WT-fL._AC_SL1001_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"COSMO","source_asin":"B0BSFS5HN9","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-147496","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BSFS5HN9","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Appliances.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BSFS5HN9","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
