window.products.push({"id":147653,"name":"Whirlpool Cabrio Washer Hub Kit W10820039 280145 Basket Drive Tub MVWB725BW0 WTW7600XW0 WTW8800YW1 WTW8900BC0 Replaces AP5985205 PS11723155 4273189 85","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":9.95,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/5147kL5ghbS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"💡 W10820039 280145 Hub Kit - A high-quality exact equivalent for part numbers AP5985205, 4273189, 8545948, 8545953, PS11723155, W10118114, W10820039VP. W10820039 Hub Kit is compatible with Whirlpool, Kenmore, Maytag appliances. The Whirlpool 280145 Hub Kit includes the necessary components to link the spin shaft and the spin basket, enabling the machine to spin. The Whirlpool Washer Part W10820039 is situated below the agitator. It fits hundreds of models and can be installed in a few minutes. 🔧 DIY eTips Included - Not sure how to replace the Basket Hub 280145? Helpful information can be found on the page below. Scroll down to get more repair tips. Acquire valuable skills during the DIY repair project. Whirlpool Hub Kit 280145 will help if your appliance is noisy, leaking, and pumps but doesn't spin or agitate. Before the repair process, make sure to unplug the washing machine and drain the water. To access the agitator, you will need to remove the top of the washing machine. 💡 The W10820039 Whirlpool Hub Kit includes two basket hubs and one driver hub. It is recommended that you replace all of them to ensure even wear. Made of both plastic and metal, this durable kit is sold individually. The kit is important as it ensures proper function of the washing machine and prevents damage from leaks or wear and tear. Maytag W10820039 Washer Hub Kit replacement meets or exceeds all manufacturer specifications. We provide a lifetime warranty and guarantee 100% money back. 💡 What does the hub do in top load washer? In a top load washer, the hub is a part of the washer's drive system that connects the agitator to the transmission. The hub is located in the center of the agitator and rotates the agitator during the wash cycle. The transmission shaft fits into the hub, and the grooves in the hub allow it to rotate the agitator. The hub plays an important role in the washer's operation, as it is responsible for transferring the power from the motor to the agitator. 💡 What should you do if your top load washer is making loud noises during the spin cycle? If your top load washer is making loud noises during the spin cycle, the basket drive hub may be worn or damaged and may need to be replaced with the 280145 Hub Kit Whirlpool. If the issue persists even after replacing the hub, it is possible that there is a problem with the transmission or other components of the washing machine, and it may be necessary to seek further assistance from a professional.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/5147kL5ghbS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"PartsBroz","source_asin":"B082VFNLZQ","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-147653","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B082VFNLZQ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Appliances.jsonl","source_asin":"B082VFNLZQ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
