window.products.push({"id":147656,"name":"Arctic Ice Chillin' Brew Series Ice Pack - Long Lasting High Performance Medium (1.5 LBS) Ice Pack for Beer, Beverages, Tailgating, Day Trips and More","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":35.18,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71XdRyz8+QL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"The Arctic Ice Chillin' Brew Series is designed with the beer drinker in mind, but is great for chilling anything kept in a cooler.Arctic Ice Chillin' Brew has a phase change (melting point) of -2.2°C, making it uniquely suited for keeping beer or other beverages at their coldest point. With the addition of Arctic Ice Chillin' Brew to a cooler, the contents not only have to be cold, they can be colder than ice. Arctic Ice Chillin' Brew is reusable for a lifetime making it a very economical choice for years of \"colder than ice\" coolers. Arctic Ice Chillin' Brew can also be used with ice to keep ice frozen up to 50% longer than an equal weight of ice alone would hold. Arctic Ice Chillin' Brew should be kept in a freezer for easy access and will refreeze in approximately 6-8 hours. Arctic Ice Chillin' Brew panels are also top rack dishwasher safe. Arctic Ice uses non-toxic, high-performance \"phase change materials\" or PCM to provide cooler temperatures anywhere from freezing cold to frozen. Each panel is ruggedly designed with extended surface area to provide exceptional cooling performance and efficiency. Spin-welded seals keep our panels leak-proof for a lifetime of use. Arctic Ice products are proudly made in the USA and are guaranteed against manufacturing defects for a lifetime.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71XdRyz8+QL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Arctic Ice","source_asin":"B08CL565YK","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-147656","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08CL565YK","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Appliances.jsonl","source_asin":"B08CL565YK","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
