window.products.push({"id":147684,"name":"HOSOM 4 Packs Anti Vibration Pads for Washing Machine, Heavy Duty Rubber Pads for Noise Dampening, Washer and Dryer Pads for Absorbing Shock","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61db7wZlx1L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Do Your Beloved Dog Be Trembled or Frightened by the Noise When Your Machine Is Running?  Do You Need to Move Your Machine Back to Its Position after Doing Laundry?  If Yes, HOSOM Washing Machine Foot Pads Is Highly Recommended to Improve the Situation Effectively.   About Products Highlights  Adhesive free, simply place each foot of machine directly into the slotted portion of each washing machine pad.  The bottom of these pads designed to sit on any surfaces, that you do not need to worry about sliding, skidding or walking.  These pads will drastically reduce the noise and vibration for both washer and dryer.  Each pad is 3” in OD and 1.77” in ID. Raise your appliance for about 1 inch.   About Specification  Material: Premium Rubber  OD: 3-inch  ID: 1.77-inch  Package: 4-pack   Warming Tips  1. As these pads are totally brand new products, it is INEVITABLE that they may have some rubber smell, you can put them at the location with good air circulation before using.  2. The indentation on top of the pads is universal in size and will work with most washers.   After-Sales Customer Service  For any inquiries when using these washer anti-vibration pads, please do not hesitate to contact us while we will serve you with a satisfactory solution.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61db7wZlx1L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"HOSOM","source_asin":"B07VB73TP1","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-147684","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07VB73TP1","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Appliances.jsonl","source_asin":"B07VB73TP1","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
