window.products.push({"id":147733,"name":"WB31M19 WB31M20 Porcelain Drip Pan Bowls - Includes 1 Pack 8-Inch WB31M19 and 3 Pack 6-Inch WB31M20 - Replacement for Ken-more GE Hotpoint Burner Elec","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":17.97,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71dYGAS1FES._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【𝙒𝘽𝟯𝟭𝙈𝟭𝟵 𝙒𝘽𝟯𝟭𝙈𝟮𝟬 𝘽𝙐𝙍𝙉𝙀𝙍 𝘿𝙍𝙄𝙋 𝙋𝘼𝙉】--The WB31M19 WB31M20 burner electric range are partially located on the top and inside of the appliance, is used to collect oil/water droplets/food that leaks during cooking and can prevent electric shock to the user, to keep it safe. Speed up cooking time, save energy and give a fresh look to the top of the cooker. ◆G-E electric stove burner drip pans are EASY TO CLEAN and can be cleaned with a cloth, paper towel, soap or dishwasher. 【𝙃𝙄𝙂𝙃-𝙌𝙐𝘼𝙇𝙄𝙏𝙔 𝙋𝙊𝙍𝘾𝙀𝙇𝘼𝙄𝙉】-- Includes 1 x 8\" WB31M19 electric burner drip pan and 3 x 6\" WB31M20 electric burner drip pans.They are made of high-quality porcelain with Chrome Finish, and have a notch in their burner support. Good hardness and high temperature resistance. Robust and durable, ensuring long-term and effective use.◆6-inch WB31M20 bowl diameter 7.6 inches,fits 6-3/8\" hole in the stove. 8-inch WB31M19 bowl diameter 9.7 inches,fits 8-1/2\" hole in the stove. 【𝟵𝟬 𝘿𝘼𝙔𝙎 𝙒𝘼𝙍𝙍𝘼𝙉𝙏𝙔】--The WB31M19 WB31M20 burner electric range porcelain drip pan bowls supports 90 days RETURN and EXCHANGE.◆The WB31M19 WB31M20 range cooktop porcelain drip pans can fixs the following symptoms: ①cookware from rocking on the stove, ②spillage of cookware to stain the burner. Before ordering this replacement, to ensure that this product is compatible with your equipment, please measure your old drip tray. 【𝘾𝙊𝙈𝙋𝘼𝙏𝙄𝘽𝙄𝙇𝙄𝙏𝙔】-- WB31M19 WB31M20 Burner electric range porcelain drip pan bowls replacement Ken-more, G-E hot-point Range.◆Replacement numbers for WB31M19 electric burner drip pan:jhp63gn1, jsp34av1aa, jhp63gn2, jbp30gy1ad, jhp63gn3ad, jhp63gn3wh, jhp63gn4ad, rb755gn6ad, rb755gn6wh,etc.◆Replacement numbers for WB31M20 electric burner drip pan: jsp26gv1wh, jsp26gp3ad, jsp26gp3wh, jsp26gp4ad, jsp26gp4wh, rb767gn1, rb755gt1ad, rb755gt1wh, rb757gt4wh, rb767gh1kk,etc. 【𝙀𝘼𝙎𝙔 𝙄𝙉𝙎𝙏𝘼𝙇𝙇𝘼𝙏𝙄𝙊𝙉】-- WB31M19 and WB31M20 drip bowls can be installed under 8 \"and 6\" burner elements.Power off and put on working gloves before installation. Wait until the surface is cool to the touch before installing this part.No tools are required for this process. You can find videos on YouTube on how to change parts, it's not hard at all.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71dYGAS1FES._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Beaquicy","source_asin":"B08KD4HRSL","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-147733","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08KD4HRSL","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Appliances.jsonl","source_asin":"B08KD4HRSL","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
