window.products.push({"id":147991,"name":"20x25x2 Merv 13 Furnace Filter (12 Pack)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31HeDDsFJjL._AC_.jpg","description":"The 20x25x2 MERV 13 Glasfloss Z-Line Series MR-13 pleated air filter features the latest in media technology to achieve MERV 13 while maintaining low pressure drop and good service life. The new Z-Line Series MR-13 pleat is optimized for \"LEED\" compliance in new and existing buildings as well as providing a cost-effective upgrade from lower efficiency pleated filters for a variety of residential, commercial, and industrial applications. The Z-Line Series MR-13 pleat is available in many standard face dimensions in 1”, 2\" and 4\" depths. Glasfloss Z-Line Series MR-13 filtration media incorporates 100% synthetic fibers which are electrostatically charged, thermally bonded and are manufactured in an engineered gradient structure. The thermally-bonded fibers do not absorb moisture. The engineered grading structure media supports high dust-holding capacity and long filter service life. ZLine Series MR-13 media is laminated to a heavy-duty, galvanized, rust-resistant metal backing that stabilizes the media during operation. The pleats are formed in a radial configuration to ensure proper dust-loading. The pleated media pack is adhered to the peripheral interior of a heavy-duty beverage board die-cut frame to prevent air bypass. The beverage-board frame creates a double-wall thickness around the perimeter of the filter. The Glasfloss Z-Line Series MR-13 was developed to comply with \"LEED\" standards in new and existing buildings. Additionally, the Z-Line Series MR-13 is a cost effective upgrade from standard pleated filters, poly ring panels and other lower efficiency panel filters and can be used is a wide variety of existing applications without modification to the existing equipment.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31HeDDsFJjL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Glasfloss","source_asin":"B0057BDAL8","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-147991","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0057BDAL8","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Appliances.jsonl","source_asin":"B0057BDAL8","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
